    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]] lobs a slimy glob at [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=P1YLDUEKG7baOYir]] it can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=P1YLDUEKG7baOYir]] feet of itself. <em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=P1YLDUEKG7baOYir]], the targeted [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=P1YLDUEKG7baOYir]]. <em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage. The glob rolls the target 60-feet straight toward the [[lookup @name lowercase]], and the target has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn, when the glob harmlessly dissolves. <em>Success:</em> [[lookup @damage.onSave capitalize activity=P1YLDUEKG7baOYir]] damage only.</p>",
